    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">&quot;You Don&apos;t Look Fat, You Look Crazy is a window into the world of Longshore&apos;s irreverent, glamorous, and stunningly visual pop-art-filled life, where bedazzled flowers sit next to diamonds and Valium boxes, Jesus holds a black Amex and Wonder Woman dresses in Chanel. With tongue-in-cheek advice straight from her canvas, such as &quot;There&apos;s No Crying At Bergdorf&apos;s,&quot; &quot;Always Ask For More,&quot; and &quot;What Would Blue Ivy Do,&quot; Ashley&apos;s honesty and DGAF attitude will grab you by your Givenchy lapels and hit you across the face with the donut you promised yourself you wouldn&apos;t eat. So be confident, grab life by the Birkins, embrace your &quot;ambitchion,&quot; and remember, you don&apos;t look fat you look crazy!&quot; Publisher website.</marc:subfield>
